sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API
    participant P as Postgres
    participant R as Relay inside API
    participant K as Kafka
    participant W as Worker
    participant V as Valkey
    C->>A: POST /claims (Idempotency-Key)
    A->>P: one transaction: INSERT claim PENDING + INSERT outbox
    A-->>C: 201 (or 200 replay / 409 conflict)
    R->>P: SELECT unsent outbox FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    R->>K: publish claims.submitted (key = claim id)
    R->>P: UPDATE outbox SET sent_at
    K->>W: claims.submitted
    W->>P: read claim, decide, UPDATE ... WHERE status = PENDING
    W->>V: DEL claim:id
    W->>K: commit offset (only after done)
    Note over W,K: transient error: retry 3x, then claims.submitted.dlq
    C->>A: GET /claims/id
    A->>V: GET claim:id (miss -> read Postgres, SET 60s)
    A-->>C: 200 APPROVED / REJECTED
